        "category_bSg7Kt": {
          "type": "category",
          "settings": {
            "category_name": "Signature Cocktails",
            "category_note": "",
            "items": "Classic Margarita $14\nJuicy, tart, and made to order. Keep it classic with lime or mix it up with fresh fruit—add a little spice if you're feeling bold.\nAdd | Make it a Cadillac +$2  |  Blackberry, Peach, Raspberry, or Strawberry +$2  |  Make it Spicy +$0.50\n\nBasil Lemonade $15\nFresh basil gives this lemonade a bright, herbaceous twist. Made with vodka, lemon juice, fresh basil, and simple syrup. Topped with soda water.\nAdd | Blackberry, Peach, Raspberry, or Strawberry +$2\n\nStrawberry Bourbon Smash $15\nFresh strawberries and mint bring a bright summer twist to this bourbon classic. Made with Old Bardstown 90 Proof Bourbon, strawberry purée, lemon juice, and fresh mint.\n\nRazzle Dazzle Vodka Lemonade $15\nBright, fruity, and bubbly. Made with Gruven Vodka, fresh raspberry purée, lemon juice, and simple syrup. Topped with Prosecco.\n\nBlackberry Mezcal Mule $16\nSmoky, fruit-forward, and refreshing. Made with Rayu Mezcal, blackberry, lime juice, and fresh mint. Topped with Fever-Tree Ginger Beer.\n\nT-Hill Espresso Martini $16\nOur take on the espresso martini, featuring locally roasted Ragamuffin Coffee. Choose vodka, tequila, or bourbon, shaken with Ragamuffin Better Day Bottled Espresso, Mario's Espresso Liqueur, and brown sugar syrup. Finished with coffee beans.\n\nT-Hill Old Fashioned $16\nOur take on the classic Old Fashioned. Made with Buffalo Trace Bourbon, brown sugar syrup, and aromatic and orange bitters. Finished with an Amarena cherry and orange peel.\nItalian Style | Add Cherry Syrup +$1\n\nBlood Orange Margarita $17\nOur blood orange twist on the classic margarita. Made with Gran Clásico Blanco Tequila, freshly squeezed blood orange juice, lime juice, and agave. Finished with a salt rim, blood orange slice, and marigold flower.\nAdd | Make it a Cadillac +$2  |  Make it Spicy +$0.50\n\nThe Peach Pit $18\nSilky, bright, and effortlessly smooth. Made with vodka, peach, lemon juice, and egg white.\n\nBarrel-Aged Maple Old Fashioned $19\nPoured straight from the barrel for a richer take on the Old Fashioned. Made with Garrison Brothers Small Batch Bourbon, barrel-aged maple syrup, and orange bitters.\n\nTarantula Tea $19\nOur elevated twist on the Long Island. Made with rum, tequila, vodka, gin, lemon, and finished with Crème de Violette.\n\nJapanese Old Fashioned $19\nA refined twist on the Old Fashioned featuring San-In Blended Japanese Whisky. Made with Japanese plum liqueur, brown sugar syrup, and aromatic and orange bitters. Finished with an Amarena cherry and orange peel.",
            "category_footer": ""
          }
        },
        "category_bCl4Rw": {
          "type": "category",
          "settings": {
            "category_name": "Classic Cocktails",
            "category_note": "",
            "items": "Bloody Mary $14\nHouse-made Bloody Mary mix with your choice of vodka or tequila.\n\nLemon Drop Martini $14\nA bright, refreshing cocktail balancing tart citrus with just the right amount of sweetness.\n\nPaloma $14\nA refreshing blend of tequila and bubbly grapefruit soda.\n\nVodka Red Bull $14\nVodka and Red Bull—simple, classic, effective.\n\nCosmopolitan $15\nBright, balanced, and citrus-forward. Made with vodka, cranberry, orange liqueur, and lime juice.\n\nFrench 75 $15\nAn elegant sparkling cocktail made with gin, lemon, simple syrup, and Prosecco—bright and effervescent.\n\nMule $15\nYour choice of liquor with lime and ginger, topped with Fever-Tree Ginger Beer. Doesn't get much more refreshing.\n\nNegroni $15\nA classic bittersweet Italian aperitif made with equal parts gin, Negroni Bitter Aperitivo, and sweet vermouth. Stirred and finished with an orange peel.\n\nMartini $16\nAn elegant and classic chilled cocktail made of vodka or gin and dry vermouth rinse.\nAdd | Dirty +$1  |  Extra Dirty +$1.50\n\nSour $16\nA balanced mix of your choice of liquor, fresh lemon, and a touch of sweetness. Add egg white for a silky finish.\nAdd | Egg Whites +$2\n\nManhattan $17\nA classic, spirit-forward cocktail made with a rye whiskey, sweet vermouth, and bitters with an Amarena cherry.",
            "category_footer": ""
          }
        },
        "category_bSh9Nq": {
          "type": "category",
          "settings": {
            "category_name": "Signature Shots",
            "category_note": "",
            "items": "Mexican Candy $8\nA sweet and tangy tequila shot with juicy mango, a hint of lime, and a Tajín rim.\nAdd some heat! | Dash of Habanero extract +$0.50\n\nLemon Drop $10\nA sweet and sour vodka shooter.\n\nBlood Orange Mexican Candy $11\nA bold twist on a favorite—sweet, citrusy, and finished with a spicy kick.\n\nGreen Tea $11\nJameson Whiskey with peach and citrus!",
            "category_footer": ""
          }
        },
        "category_bMk5Vd": {
          "type": "category",
          "settings": {
            "category_name": "Mocktails",
            "category_note": "",
            "items": "\"No es Real\" Non-Alc Margarita $10\nNo alcohol, but muy buena.\n\nNo-Jito $10\nNo buzz, no problem. Made with fresh squeezed lime juice, mint leaves, and simple syrup. Topped with bubbly soda water.\n\nTropical Sipper $12\nA bright, fruity island escape with pineapple, strawberry, coconut, lime juice and simple syrup.\n\nNon-Alc Blood Orange Margarita $13\nA booze-free take on one of our fan-favorite signature cocktails.",
            "category_footer": ""
          }
        },
        "category_bSp2Hz": {
          "type": "category",
          "settings": {
            "category_name": "Spritzes",
            "category_note": "",
            "items": "Aperol Spritz $14\nA classic Italian cocktail known for its light, bubbly texture and bittersweet citrus flavor. Made with Aperol, Prosecco, and soda water. Finished with an orange slice.\n\nHugo Spritz $16\nA light, floral spritz with St-Germain Elderflower Liqueur, Prosecco, soda water, and fresh mint.",
            "category_footer": ""
          }
        },
        "category_bFz3Lp": {
          "type": "category",
          "settings": {
            "category_name": "Frozen Cocktails",
            "category_note": "",
            "items": "Frozen Blood Orange Margarita $17\nOur blood orange twist on the classic frozen margarita. Made with Gran Clásico Blanco Tequila, freshly squeezed blood orange juice, lime juice, and agave. Finished with a Tajín rim, blood orange slice, and marigold flower.\n\nMalibu Frosé $17\nLight, fruity, and refreshing. Made with Saddlerock Rosé, strawberries, and fresh lemon juice.\n\nPina Colada $17\nA creamy, tropical blend of pineapple and coconut—smooth, refreshing, and easy to sip.\n\nFrozen Cocktail Flight $25\nEverything looking good? Why not try them all? Get a sample of all three frozen cocktail options.",
            "category_footer": ""
